sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User / SDK
    participant Frontend as Frontend<br/>3000/TCP HTTP
    participant APIServer as API Server<br/>8888/TCP HTTP<br/>8887/TCP gRPC
    participant MySQL as MySQL<br/>3306/TCP
    participant MinIO as MinIO<br/>9000/TCP HTTP
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Tekton as Tekton Controller
    participant CacheServer as Cache Server<br/>8443/TCP HTTPS
    participant PersistAgent as Persistence Agent
    participant MLMD as ML Metadata<br/>8080/TCP gRPC

    Note over User,MLMD: Flow 1: Pipeline Upload and Execution

    User->>Frontend: Upload pipeline YAML<br/>HTTP/80, TLS at gateway<br/>OAuth / kubeflow-userid
    Frontend->>APIServer: POST /apis/v1beta1/pipelines/upload<br/>HTTP/8888, Istio mTLS<br/>Bearer Token
    APIServer->>MySQL: Store pipeline metadata<br/>TCP/3306, Istio mTLS<br/>Password auth
    APIServer->>MinIO: Store pipeline artifact<br/>HTTP/9000, Istio mTLS<br/>Access key
    APIServer-->>Frontend: Pipeline created

    User->>APIServer: Create Run<br/>gRPC/8887, Istio mTLS<br/>Bearer Token
    APIServer->>K8sAPI: Create PipelineRun CR<br/>HTTPS/6443, TLS 1.2+<br/>ServiceAccount token
    K8sAPI->>Tekton: Reconcile PipelineRun
    Tekton->>K8sAPI: Create TaskRun pods

    Note over User,MLMD: Flow 2: Cache Evaluation (Mutating Webhook)

    K8sAPI->>CacheServer: Admission Review<br/>HTTPS/443, TLS<br/>Webhook cert
    CacheServer->>MySQL: Check cache (cachedb)<br/>TCP/3306, Istio mTLS<br/>Password
    MySQL-->>CacheServer: Cache hit/miss
    CacheServer-->>K8sAPI: Mutated pod spec<br/>(skip step if cached)

    Note over User,MLMD: Flow 3: Run Status Synchronization

    PersistAgent->>K8sAPI: Watch PipelineRuns<br/>HTTPS/6443, TLS 1.2+<br/>ServiceAccount token
    K8sAPI-->>PersistAgent: PipelineRun status updates
    PersistAgent->>APIServer: Sync run status<br/>HTTP/8888, Istio mTLS
    APIServer->>MySQL: Update run record<br/>TCP/3306

    Note over User,MLMD: Flow 4: Metadata Tracking

    PersistAgent->>MLMD: Write run metadata<br/>gRPC/8080, no TLS
